User should be able to authenticate using email - phone number to avoid duplicate accounts

User should be able to access a dashboard with all trial services suggested by the application..

Services should be sorted according to their type 

Dashboard should have a filter according to the type && price

User should be able to add his location and get the closest services to his current location

User should be able to click on a certain service and get information about this service - price - requirements to benefit from trial

THe user should be able to book a trial with the service

The user should only be able to book the trial by paying the fee required by using google pay -- paypal and bank card

